{"sha": "d7f2316bb39098fbdd3170b4420a2f5641e3b24ddc4d94a34961e8f8c493c52c", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:matrix} 章 --- 矩阵与图}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:matrix:1}", "\\[", "A + B = \\begin{pmatrix} 3 & 2\\\\ 1 & 2\\end{pmatrix}, \\quad", "AB = \\begin{pmatrix} 4 & 2\\\\ 1 & 1\\end{pmatrix}, \\quad", "BA = \\begin{pmatrix} 2 & 4\\\\ 1 & 3\\end{pmatrix}, \\quad", "A^2 = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 4\\\\ 0 & 1\\end{pmatrix}.", "\\]", "注 $AB \\neq BA$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:matrix:2}", "$\\det A = 6 - 5 = 1 \\neq 0$:", "$A^{-1} = \\begin{pmatrix} 3 & -5\\\\ -1 & 2 \\end{pmatrix}$.", "$\\det B = 12 - 12 = 0$：$B$ 不可逆。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:matrix:3}", "方程组为 $AX = Y$，其中 $A$ 与\\cref{exo:g12:matrix:2}相同，且", "$Y = \\begin{pmatrix} 1\\\\ 2\\end{pmatrix}$：", "\\[", "X = A^{-1}Y = \\begin{pmatrix} 3 & -5\\\\ -1 & 2\\end{pmatrix}", "\\begin{pmatrix} 1\\\\ 2\\end{pmatrix}", "= \\begin{pmatrix} -7\\\\ 3\\end{pmatrix}:", "\\qquad x = -7,\\ y = 3 .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:matrix:4}", "\\emph{1.} $N^2 = \\begin{pmatrix} 0&1\\\\0&0\\end{pmatrix}", "\\begin{pmatrix} 0&1\\\\0&0\\end{pmatrix} = 0$，且 $I$ 与每个", "矩阵都可交换。", "", "\\emph{2.} 由于两项可交换，可用二项式定理，且", "所有含 $N^2$ 的项均为零：", "\\[", "A^k = (2I + N)^k = 2^k I + k\\,2^{k-1} N", "= \\begin{pmatrix} 2^k & k\\,2^{k-1}\\\\ 0 & 2^k \\end{pmatrix}.", "\\]", "当 $k = 2$ 时检验：", "$A^2 = \\begin{pmatrix} 2&1\\\\0&2\\end{pmatrix}^2", "= \\begin{pmatrix} 4&4\\\\0&4\\end{pmatrix}$，而公式给出", "$2^2 = 4$, $2 \\times 2 = 4$. \\checkmark", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:matrix:5}", "\\emph{归纳法。}当 $n = 1$ 时：", "$A^1 = \\begin{pmatrix} 0&1\\\\1&1\\end{pmatrix}", "= \\begin{pmatrix} F_0 & F_1\\\\ F_1 & F_2\\end{pmatrix}$。设公式对", "$n$ 成立，则", "\\[", "A^{n+1} = A^n A", "= \\begin{pmatrix} F_{n-1} & F_n\\\\ F_n & F_{n+1}\\end{pmatrix}", "\\begin{pmatrix} 0 & 1\\\\ 1 & 1\\end{pmatrix}", "= \\begin{pmatrix} F_n & F_{n-1} + F_n\\\\ F_{n+1} & F_n + F_{n+1}\\end{pmatrix}", "= \\begin{pmatrix} F_n & F_{n+1}\\\\ F_{n+1} & F_{n+2}\\end{pmatrix}.", "\\]", "\\emph{恒等式。}对 $2\\times2$ 矩阵，展开可知", "$\\det(MN) = \\det M \\det N$；由此", "可得 $\\det(A^n) = (\\det A)^n = (-1)^n$，且", "$\\det A^n = F_{n-1}F_{n+1} - F_n^2$。（这就是\\emph{卡西尼恒等式}。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:matrix:6}", "\\emph{1.} 顶点按 $1, 2, 3$ 排序：", "\\[", "M = \\begin{pmatrix} 0&1&1\\\\ 0&0&1\\\\ 1&0&0\\end{pmatrix}, \\quad", "M^2 = \\begin{pmatrix} 1&0&1\\\\ 1&0&0\\\\ 0&1&1\\end{pmatrix}, \\quad", "M^3 = \\begin{pmatrix} 1&1&1\\\\ 1&0&1\\\\ 1&0&1 \\end{pmatrix}.", "\\]", "", "\\emph{2.} $\\bigl(M^3\\bigr)_{11} = 1$：长为 $3$ 的闭途径中，", "从顶点 $1$ 出发的恰有一条，即 $1 \\to 2 \\to 3 \\to 1$。（途径", "$1 \\to 3 \\to 1$ 的长度仅为 $2$，而 $1 \\to 3$ 后接 $3\\to1$ 再接", "$1\\to3$ 则终止于 $3$。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:matrix:7}", "\\emph{1.} $a_{n+1} = 0.8a_n + 0.3b_n$, $b_{n+1} = 0.2a_n + 0.7b_n$:", "$M = \\begin{pmatrix} 0.8 & 0.3\\\\ 0.2 & 0.7\\end{pmatrix}$.", "", "\\emph{2.} $MX = X$ 给出 $0.8a + 0.3b = a$，\\emph{即} $0.3b = 0.2a$，故", "$b = \\frac23 a$；结合 $a + b = 1$：$a = 0.6$，$b = 0.4$。", "", "\\emph{3.} 利用 $b_n = 1 - a_n$：", "$a_{n+1} = 0.8a_n + 0.3(1 - a_n) = 0.5a_n + 0.3$，故", "\\[", "c_{n+1} = a_{n+1} - 0.6 = 0.5a_n + 0.3 - 0.6 = 0.5(a_n - 0.6) = 0.5\\,c_n .", "\\]", "故 $c_n = 0.5^n c_0 \\to 0$：$a_n \\to 0.6$ 且 $b_n \\to 0.4$，无论", "初始分布如何。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:matrix:8}", "\\emph{1.} $\\det P = -2$，故", "$P^{-1} = -\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix} -1 & -1\\\\ -1 & 1\\end{pmatrix}", "= \\frac12\\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 1\\\\ 1 & -1\\end{pmatrix}$。则", "\\[", "AP = \\begin{pmatrix} 4 & 2\\\\ 4 & -2 \\end{pmatrix}, \\qquad", "D = P^{-1}AP = \\frac12\\begin{pmatrix} 1&1\\\\1&-1\\end{pmatrix}", "\\begin{pmatrix} 4&2\\\\4&-2\\end{pmatrix}", "= \\begin{pmatrix} 4 & 0\\\\ 0 & 2\\end{pmatrix}.", "\\]", "", "\\emph{2.} 由 $A = PDP^{-1}$，经归纳可得", "$A^n = PD^nP^{-1}$，其中", "$D^n = \\begin{pmatrix} 4^n & 0\\\\ 0 & 2^n\\end{pmatrix}$，故", "\\[", "A^n = P D^n P^{-1}", "= \\begin{pmatrix} 4^n & 2^n\\\\ 4^n & -2^n\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot", "\\frac12\\begin{pmatrix} 1&1\\\\1&-1\\end{pmatrix}", "= \\frac12\\begin{pmatrix} 4^n + 2^n & 4^n - 2^n\\\\", "4^n - 2^n & 4^n + 2^n\\end{pmatrix}.", "\\]", "将 $A^n$ 作用于 $X_0 = \\begin{pmatrix} u_0\\\\v_0\\end{pmatrix}$，", "恰好重现\\cref{ex:g12:matrix:coupled}中的公式。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}